            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This article provides an overview of the current neurological malpractice trends, and outlines management strategies for several common recurring claims involving headache, stroke, and epilepsy. Selected nonmalpractice liability issues are reviewed, focusing on the unique risks engendered by the forensic expert.</AbstractText>
